  "transcriptionNotes": [
    "INEC GOMBE-STATE.pdf returned404; all11 names are from the Gombe State Government LGA page, cross-checked against OSGF First Schedule.",
    "INEC office descriptors are not LGAs: Bauchi Kofar Ran -> Bauchi; Ohafia Amaekpu -> Ohafia; FCT AMAC -> Abuja Municipal; Borno MMC -> Maiduguri; Kogi K.K. -> Kogi.",
    "INEC Abia last row wraps UMU-/NNEOCHI across columns -> Umu-Neochi; Isialangwa normalized to Isiala Ngwa.",
    "INEC Kano row36 says DJ but address identifies Sumaila; OSGF First Schedule confirms Sumaila. Nassarawa normalized to Nasarawa.",
    "INEC Kebbi omits row3; OSGF First Schedule confirms missing Arewa-Dandi.",
    "INEC Nasarawa Eggon wraps across rows. Calabar Municipality expands the wrapped label.",
    "OSGF First Schedule supports corrected obvious INEC typos: Katsina-Ala, Onicha, Uhunmwonde, Ado Ekiti, Nkwerre, Hadejia, Kiri Kasamma; Enugu joined/space artifacts normalized.",
    "Case was normalized for display; official INEC spelling variants were retained elsewhere rather than fuzzy-matching arbitrary user text."
  ]
